  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/T1cDttyv/farmers-knives-banner.png\" alt=\"農夫之刀\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為《農夫的喜悅》增添了許多模組材質的刀具！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支援清單：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adabranium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Adabranium</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">振金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">艾德曼合金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地獄磚</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">玫瑰金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鍍金獄髓金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓金屬-鐵</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓金屬-金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓金屬-綠寶石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">獄髓金屬-鑽石</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aphid-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aphid Additions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">幾丁質</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">塔拉希烏姆</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">終末金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">永恆金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">辛辛納提石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">辛辛納提石-鑽石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地獄紅寶石</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">魔鋼</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">元素金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地幔鋼</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conjuring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Conjuring</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">靈魂合金</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-age-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Age Backport</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff and Additions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">黃銅<br>鋅</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">監守者</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragonloot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragon Loot</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">龍</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-tools-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Emerald Tools &amp; More</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">綠寶石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">紅寶石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">紫水晶</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋼</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">黑曜石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-reborn-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Reborn</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">殘餘金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">羽翎金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderite Mod</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">終界金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">戈伯金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地獄戈伯金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">終界戈伯金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">亞當精金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">水族金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">班格魯金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">青銅</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">卡莫特金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">天界金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">堅鋼</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">聖潔金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">凱伯金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">傳奇班格魯金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">冶金金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">秘銀</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">山銅</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋨</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">釕</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">普羅米修斯金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">四元金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">符文金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">白金之星</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋼</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">風暴金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">潮汐歌者</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">彭多金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/progression-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progression Reborn</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">玫瑰金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鐵木</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">烈焰金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">鋼葉金屬</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">騎士金屬</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">銅</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/winterly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Winterly</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">寒霜大理石</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>截至 2.1 版本的所有刀具：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8zPxdqC/image-2022-08-17-164723137.png\" alt=\"刀具\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（不包含 Twilight Forest、Adabranium、Advanced Netherite、Winterly、Mythic Metals 的 Tidesinger、Progression Reborn、End Reborn 與 Create Stuff &amp; Additions）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>鳴謝：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Mythic Metals 刀具紋理由 The Skeleton Appears 提供</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多建議請<a href=\"https://github.com/ianm1647/farmersknives/issues/1\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處</a>提出！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">點擊下方任一連結，查看我的其他作品：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qyYwHykSmE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KrWjv8p/discord-rectangle-500x160.png\" alt=\"加入 Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ianm1647/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vmx15sd/download.png\" alt=\"我的 GitHub\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
